sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Retailer as Retailer
    actor Operator as Authorized Staff

    participant Mobile as Retailer Mobile App
    participant Portal as Web Portal

    participant ARApi as RetailerReceivablesController
    participant PaymentApi as PaymentsController

    participant ARSvc as RetailerReceivableService
    participant PaymentSvc as PaymentService

    participant ARStore as RetailerReceivableStore
    participant PaymentStore as PaymentStore

    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    %% ==========================================
    %% PART 1 - VIEW RETAILER RECEIVABLES
    %% ==========================================

    Note over Retailer,DB: PART 1 - VIEW RETAILER RECEIVABLES

    Retailer->>+Mobile: Open receivables and select filters

    Mobile->>+ARApi: List(filter)

    ARApi->>+ARSvc: ListAsync(filter, userId, ct)

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. VALIDATE FILTER
    %% ==========================================

    ARSvc->>+ARSvc: Validate(filter)
    ARSvc-->>ARSvc: Validation result
    deactivate ARSvc

    alt Invalid pagination, date range or filter

        Note right of ARSvc: Return Validation error

    else Filter is valid

        %% ==========================================
        %% 2. RESOLVE CURRENT BUSINESS DATE
        %% ==========================================

        ARSvc->>+ARSvc: Today()
        ARSvc-->>ARSvc: Current business date
        deactivate ARSvc

        %% ==========================================
        %% 3. LOAD SCOPED RECEIVABLES
        %% ==========================================

        ARSvc->>+ARStore: ListAsync(userId, filter, ct)

        ARStore->>+ARStore: LoadAsync(userId, ct)

        ARStore->>+DB: SELECT scoped SalesOrders and Payments

        Note right of DB: Include settlement and financial adjustment data

        Note right of DB: Include collection, dispute and refund history

        DB-->>ARStore: Receivable source data
        deactivate DB

        ARStore-->>ARStore: RetailerReceivableView collection
        deactivate ARStore

        ARStore-->>ARSvc: RetailerReceivableView collection
        deactivate ARStore

        %% ==========================================
        %% 4. CALCULATE RECEIVABLE RESULTS
        %% ==========================================

        loop For each receivable

            ARSvc->>+ARSvc: ToResult(receivableView, today)

            Note right of ARSvc: Calculate balances and derived payment status

            alt DueDate exists and collectible balance is overdue

                Note right of ARSvc: Report receivable as Overdue

            else Payment is fully settled

                Note right of ARSvc: Report settled balance

            else DueDate is not established

                Note right of ARSvc: Do not report as overdue

            else Receivable is not yet overdue

                Note right of ARSvc: Report current receivable status

            end

            ARSvc-->>ARSvc: RetailerReceivableResult
            deactivate ARSvc

        end

        %% ==========================================
        %% 5. APPLY STATUS FILTER
        %% ==========================================

        ARSvc->>+ARSvc: NormalizeStatus(filter.Status)

        ARSvc-->>ARSvc: Normalized status filter
        deactivate ARSvc

        Note right of ARSvc: Apply status filter and deterministic pagination

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 6. RETURN RECEIVABLE LIST
    %% ==========================================

    ARSvc-->>ARApi: RetailerReceivablePage or error
    deactivate ARSvc

    ARApi-->>Mobile: Receivables response
    deactivate ARApi

    Mobile-->>Retailer: Display balances, DueDates and statuses
    deactivate Mobile

    %% ==========================================
    %% PART 2 - VIEW RECEIVABLE BY ORDER
    %% ==========================================

    opt Retailer opens one SalesOrder receivable

        Retailer->>+Mobile: View receivable details for SalesOrder

        Mobile->>+ARApi: GetByOrder(orderId)

        ARApi->>+ARSvc: GetByOrderAsync(orderId, userId, ct)

        %% ==========================================
        %% 7. LOAD ORDER RECEIVABLE
        %% ==========================================

        ARSvc->>+ARStore: FindByOrderAsync(orderId, userId, ct)

        ARStore->>+ARStore: LoadAsync(userId, ct)

        ARStore->>+DB: SELECT scoped Payment and SalesOrder details

        Note right of DB: Include collection, dispute and refund history

        DB-->>ARStore: Receivable detail or null
        deactivate DB

        ARStore-->>ARStore: RetailerReceivableView or null
        deactivate ARStore

        ARStore-->>ARSvc: Receivable detail or null
        deactivate ARStore

        %% ==========================================
        %% 8. VALIDATE ORDER SCOPE
        %% ==========================================

        alt Order does not exist or is outside Retailer scope

            Note right of ARSvc: Return Not Found

        else Retailer can view the order

            ARSvc->>+ARSvc: Today()
            ARSvc-->>ARSvc: Current business date
            deactivate ARSvc

            ARSvc->>+ARSvc: ToResult(receivableView, today)

            Note right of ARSvc: Calculate current outstanding and overdue information

            ARSvc-->>ARSvc: RetailerReceivableResult
            deactivate ARSvc

        end

        %% ==========================================
        %% 9. RETURN ORDER RECEIVABLE
        %% ==========================================

        ARSvc-->>ARApi: RetailerReceivableResult or error
        deactivate ARSvc

        ARApi-->>Mobile: Order receivable response
        deactivate ARApi

        Mobile-->>Retailer: Display payment and receivable details
        deactivate Mobile

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% PART 3 - MONITOR PAYMENT STATUS
    %% ==========================================

    Note over Operator,DB: PART 3 - MONITOR PAYMENT STATUS

    Operator->>+Portal: Open Payment Management

    Portal->>+PaymentApi: List(statusFilter, otherFilters)

    PaymentApi->>+PaymentSvc: ListAsync(actorId, role, filters, ct)

    %% ==========================================
    %% 10. VALIDATE PAYMENT READ ROLE
    %% ==========================================

    PaymentSvc->>+PaymentSvc: ValidateReadRole(role)

    PaymentSvc-->>PaymentSvc: Authorization result
    deactivate PaymentSvc

    alt Actor is not authorized

        Note right of PaymentSvc: Return Forbidden

    else Actor has payment read permission

        %% ==========================================
        %% 11. NORMALIZE PAYMENT STATUS FILTER
        %% ==========================================

        PaymentSvc->>+PaymentSvc: NormalizeStatus(statusFilter)

        PaymentSvc-->>PaymentSvc: Normalized status
        deactivate PaymentSvc

        %% ==========================================
        %% 12. LOAD PAYMENT RECORDS
        %% ==========================================

        PaymentSvc->>+PaymentStore: ListAsync(actorId, role, filters, ct)

        PaymentStore->>+DB: SELECT Payments and related SalesOrders

        Note right of DB: Apply supported filtering and access scope

        DB-->>PaymentStore: PaymentView collection
        deactivate DB

        PaymentStore-->>PaymentSvc: PaymentView collection
        deactivate PaymentStore

        %% ==========================================
        %% 13. CALCULATE PAYMENT STATUS
        %% ==========================================

        PaymentSvc->>+PaymentSvc: Today()

        PaymentSvc-->>PaymentSvc: Current business date
        deactivate PaymentSvc

        loop For each PaymentView

            PaymentSvc->>+PaymentSvc: ToResult(paymentView, today)

            Note right of PaymentSvc: Evaluate due date and confirmed amount

            alt Outstanding payment is past its DueDate

                Note right of PaymentSvc: Present overdue status

            else Payment is settled

                Note right of PaymentSvc: Present settled status

            else Payment remains outstanding

                Note right of PaymentSvc: Present applicable current status

            end

            PaymentSvc-->>PaymentSvc: PaymentResult
            deactivate PaymentSvc

        end

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 14. RETURN PAYMENT LIST
    %% ==========================================

    PaymentSvc-->>PaymentApi: PaymentResult collection or error
    deactivate PaymentSvc

    PaymentApi-->>Portal: Payment list response
    deactivate PaymentApi

    Portal-->>Operator: Display payment statuses and DueDates
    deactivate Portal

    %% ==========================================
    %% PART 4 - VIEW PAYMENT BY ORDER
    %% ==========================================

    opt Authorized staff opens Payment details

        Operator->>+Portal: View Payment by SalesOrder

        Portal->>+PaymentApi: GetByOrder(orderId)

        PaymentApi->>+PaymentSvc: GetByOrderAsync(orderId, actorId, role, ct)

        %% ==========================================
        %% 15. VALIDATE PAYMENT READ ACCESS
        %% ==========================================

        PaymentSvc->>+PaymentSvc: ValidateReadRole(role)

        PaymentSvc-->>PaymentSvc: Authorization result
        deactivate PaymentSvc

        alt Actor does not have permission

            Note right of PaymentSvc: Return Forbidden

        else Actor has permission

            %% ==========================================
            %% 16. LOAD PAYMENT
            %% ==========================================

            PaymentSvc->>+PaymentStore: FindByOrderAsync(orderId, ct)

            PaymentStore->>+DB: SELECT Payment for SalesOrder

            DB-->>PaymentStore: PaymentView or null
            deactivate DB

            PaymentStore-->>PaymentSvc: PaymentView or null
            deactivate PaymentStore

            %% ==========================================
            %% 17. CHECK ACCESS SCOPE
            %% ==========================================

            alt Payment does not exist

                Note right of PaymentSvc: Return Not Found

            else Payment exists

                PaymentSvc->>+PaymentStore: CanViewAsync(orderId, actorId, role, ct)

                PaymentStore->>+DB: SELECT order access scope

                DB-->>PaymentStore: Access result
                deactivate DB

                PaymentStore-->>PaymentSvc: Authorized or Forbidden
                deactivate PaymentStore

                alt Access is denied

                    Note right of PaymentSvc: Return Forbidden

                else Access is allowed

                    PaymentSvc->>+PaymentSvc: Today()

                    PaymentSvc-->>PaymentSvc: Current business date
                    deactivate PaymentSvc

                    PaymentSvc->>+PaymentSvc: ToResult(paymentView, today)

                    PaymentSvc-->>PaymentSvc: PaymentResult
                    deactivate PaymentSvc

                end

            end

        end

        %% ==========================================
        %% 18. RETURN PAYMENT DETAILS
        %% ==========================================

        PaymentSvc-->>PaymentApi: PaymentResult or error
        deactivate PaymentSvc

        PaymentApi-->>Portal: Payment detail response
        deactivate PaymentApi

        Portal-->>Operator: Display payment status and outstanding amount
        deactivate Portal

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% BUSINESS CONSTRAINTS
    %% ==========================================

    Note over ARSvc,DB: Receivable monitoring is read-only

    Note over ARSvc,DB: Overdue is evaluated using current business date

    Note over ARSvc,DB: An unset DueDate must not trigger overdue status

    Note over PaymentSvc,DB: Confirmed collections and adjustments affect balances

    Note over PaymentSvc,DB: A read request does not update Payment or create receipts

    Note over ARSvc,DB: No automatic debt reminder job is included in this implementation